[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Format select [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mHow should `export` determine the output format?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mRequired --format flag (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246m--format csv|json, always explicit. No guessing in unattended runs.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Infer from --out extension
     [38;5;246mreport.csv writes CSV. Unknown extensions error out.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Infer, --format overrides
